# nakaraan, "past"/"last", with its linker form; and noong, the adverb that
# "indicates past time", which is what selects the PRECEDING instance of a
# named day ("noong Lunes" == the Monday just gone, not the coming one).
# en.wiktionary.org, nakaraan; en.wiktionary.org, noon.
nakaraan
nakaraang
noong
